{{- /*
The clock's own hand: every aging law advances the one clock the leg built
the subject on.

A closure rather than the method value `clk.Advance`. The law literal is
an argument to the leg, so it is built before the factory has run and the
variable is still nil — a method value taken there binds the nil receiver
and panics on the first advance, where the closure reads whichever clock
the current iteration built.
*/ -}}
{{- define "model.lawfield.Advance" -}}
{{ .Name }}: func(d {{ renderExpr (external "time" "Duration") }}) { clk.Advance(d) }
{{- end -}}
